OL,4,CGTA 6 drives spike in download demand, 
OL,5,Cas estimated sales top $2.3bn          
OL,6,GGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to be  
OL,7,Gthe biggest entertainment launch in    
OL,8,Ghistory after the blockbuster video    
OL,9,Ggame debuted on Thursday, following a  
OL,10,G13-year wait.                          
OL,12,FInternet infrastructure firm           
OL,13,FCloudflare said PS5 downloads in the   
OL,14,FUK peaked at 8.6 times normal levels   
OL,15,Faround its launch. New Zealand, where  
OL,16,FGTA 6 was first available, saw a 14.8- 
OL,17,Ffold spike four hours before,          
OL,18,Fsuggesting some players switched       
OL,19,Fregions for early access.              
